/* ============================================================
   DISHA Career Lab - expanded internal question bank
   ------------------------------------------------------------
   DATA ONLY. No logic lives here, so it is safe to edit by hand.

   Adds to the existing pool (bundle bank + content pack + elite
   layer) to take the internal bank past 500 items, which is what
   makes the 75 / 100 / 125 / 150 per-class papers servable.

   dim 0 = Interest      tag: P I A S E O   sub: subject affinity
   dim 1 = Aptitude      apt: num|log|verb|spa   level: core|advanced
                         exactly one option carries correct:true
   dim 2 = Personality   tag: detail explore calm people solo lead
   dim 3 = Orientation   tag: secure venture expert service mobile
                              local earnEarly degree longHaul field
                              desk peopleWork
   dim 4 = Emotional     each option carries eq: 0 | 1 | 2

   sect:"subject" marks the Class 8-10 subject-interest block.
   Those are six-point Likert items (Strongly Agree ... Not
   Applicable). They score as SUBJECT AFFINITY ONLY - each option
   carries its own pre-scaled sub map - so they rank paths inside
   a stream without distorting the RIASEC interest code. "Not
   Applicable" and "Neutral" both contribute nothing, by design.
   ============================================================ */
